{"path":"ranges/drop_view/end","title":"std::ranges::drop_view<V>::end","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ranges::drop_view&lt;V&gt;::</span>end","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/drop_view/end","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a sentinel or an iterator representing the end of the drop_view.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> end<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> requires <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*simple-view*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> end<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> requires <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/range\"><span class=\"kw2916\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a sentinel or an iterator representing the end of the <code>drop_view</code>.\n</p><p>Effectively returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/end\"><span class=\"kw2902\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">end</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, where <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/drop_view#Data_members\"><code><i>base_</i></code></a> is the underlying view.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A sentinel or an iterator representing the end of the view.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;algorithm&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iterator&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ranges&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> ranges <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">ranges</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span> url<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"https://cppreference.com\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> p <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/distance\"><span class=\"kw678\">std::<span class=\"me2\">distance</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/begin\"><span class=\"kw2900\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>url<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/ranges/find\"><span class=\"kw3002\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">find</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>url, <span class=\"st0\">'/'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> site <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/drop_view\"><span class=\"kw2945\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">drop_view</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span>url, p <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// drop the prefix \"https://\"</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> it <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> site.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> it <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> site.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>it<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>it<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>cppreference.com</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/drop_view/begin\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>begin</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns an iterator to the beginning <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/begin\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ranges::begin</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> returns an iterator to t